// Build settings for the GPXNav app target.
//
// There is no MapTiler key here any more. The key lives in the tile proxy's
// secrets (see proxy/README.md) and the app only needs the proxy's address.
// Copy the example to a gitignored sibling and fill it in:
//
//   cp Secrets.local.xcconfig.example Secrets.local.xcconfig
//
// The base URL is deliberately split into a scheme and a host rather than
// written as one `https://…` value. xcconfig treats `//` as the start of a
// comment, so `TILE_PROXY_BASE_URL = https://example` silently resolves to
// `https:` and the app quietly falls back to the demo basemap. Quoting does not
// help, and `\/` lands in the Info.plist as literal backslashes. project.yml
// reassembles the two halves, where no `//` is ever adjacent.
//
// The `#include?` below is optional on purpose: without Secrets.local.xcconfig
// the app still builds, it just falls back to MapLibre's keyless demo basemap
// and says so on screen. A plain `#include` here would instead break the build
// for anyone who has not set a proxy up yet.

TILE_PROXY_SCHEME =
TILE_PROXY_HOST =

#include? "Secrets.local.xcconfig"
